Subject: [PATCH 8/9] Install the game studio's skills where the agent finds
 them

At startup the app copies the payload's skills (resources/harness/skills)
into <GOOSE_PATH_ROOT>/config/skills, replacing older copies of its own
skills and removing ones a newer version dropped, without touching skills
the user added.
